      "status_terms_zh": [
        "减速",
        "晕眩"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Taliyah throws a volley of rocks in a target direction, moving freely as she casts. This creates Worked Ground below her. If Taliyah casts Threaded Volley on Worked Ground, she consumes the ground to throw a stronger boulder that slows enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "塔莉垭朝目标方向扔出一串岩石，同时自身可自由移动。这个技能会在她脚下生成【掘石场】。如果塔莉垭在【掘石场】上使用【Q石穿】，她将消耗掉【掘石场】来投掷一颗更强大的岩石来减速敌人。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309722:4013247"
      ]
    },
